// Insertions cascade: an inserted beat can insert others, with arguments. The
// strategy of the first block decides for all of them: here `first` stops at
// the first eligible rule, in the order of the insertions.

beat Start
  Greet("Ana")
  Greet("Bob")
  Greet("Cy")

beat Greet(name)
  when first
    + Formal(name)
    true
      Hi.

beat Formal(who)
  when
    + Titles(who)
    who is "Ana"
      Good day, Ana.

beat Titles(person)
  Checking titles for $person.

  when
    person is "Bob"
      Sir Bob.
  Titles epilogue.

/*
<test>
- expected: |
    ~ Checking titles for Ana.

    ~ Good day, Ana.

    ~ Checking titles for Bob.

    ~ Sir Bob.

    ~ Titles epilogue.

    ~ Checking titles for Cy.

    ~ Hi.
</test>
*/
